  "decision_summary": "The query is a lipophilic long-chain ester prodrug; analogous long-chain fatty acid esters (testosterone undecanoate, dimethandrolone undecanoate) show low oral bioavailability (3.7–6.8% and poor/inconsistent), supporting F < 20%.",
